# UsersView — Folder Rules

> Pre-edit hook injects the full `RULES.md` chain. Canonical source: `app.vigil/src/modules/User/views/Users/RULES.md`.

Reference implementation for list + dialog CRUD in app.vigil. Follow `celer-07-view-patterns.mdc`.

## Intentional decisions

- **`allUsersForSearch` vs `users`** — search ref holds full list; `users` is filtered subset
- **`onDialogSuccess`** — granular add/replace by ID; no full refetch
- **Archive/delete** — raw `ConfirmPopup` with groups `'archive'` / `'delete'` (not `MConfirmPopup`)
- **Inline skeleton grid** — intentional; no separate skeleton component
- **`canCreate` / `canRead`** — permission guards in the view, not in `MUserCard`
- **`MMainDialog`** keyed on `editingUser?.id ?? 'new'`

## Do not

- Merge archive/delete confirm groups
- Add a dedicated skeleton component unless reused elsewhere
- Full list refetch after create/update/delete
